{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le12ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le12ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le12ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn9le12ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "Leo has always been superstitious. He's been carrying a rabbit's foot his whole life! He believes all the old wives' tales he's ever heard. When I asked him why he said, \"Why take chances? People have believed these things for many generations. I have always felt that it was better to be safe than sorry when it came to that sort of thing.\u201d", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn9le12ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "One day Leo was walking down a quiet street. Suddenly he saw a black cat. He immediately turned the corner and stepped into a narrow alley, safely avoiding the black cat. He did not realize at first that something was happening in the alley. A young woman was on a ladder. She was climbing up the ladder to get in through a window about three floors up. When Leo turned into the alley, he was heading under the ladder at full speed! He saw another black cat and froze. That's when he noticed the ladder was standing there.", "id": 2, "time": "21000"}, {"image": "engenn9le12ob10re2img03.jpg", "text": "If he hadn't seen the cat, things might have ended differently! If he hadn't noticed the ladder, he wouldn't have looked up. If he hadn't looked up he wouldn't have noticed the young woman, who we all know as Tanya now, losing her balance.\nIf he hadn't thought quickly, she could have been badly injured. If Tom hadn't broken Tanya's fall, they never would have met. The two of them ended up in a heap on the ground. They dusted themselves off, laughed, and went out for lunch. The rest, as they say, is history!", "